    "Read verified frozen two-model eight pools, keeping exact old fields/order and original train48/held16/nested32 lineage; do not start from BioBERT prepared pools.",
    "Produce independent NCR input-only cache with actual native1..7/>.8/10ensemble policy and current-HPO mapping; retain actual raw ID/offset/score provenance. Do not reuse BioBERT244938 forward cache,17,266-column labelmap,5dp>.95 gate, dictionary/abbreviation source flags.",
    "Merge actual accepted NCR keys onto original pools by exact doc+offset+length+currentHPO; preserve existing probability,similarity,base,CRF,public_,bioformer_ fields for shared keys. New keys get explicit missing semantic defaults and a new NCR-specific namespace.",
    "Exclude all biobert_ columns. Freeze NCR feature meanings from its actual neural-only pipeline; do not blindly copy BioBERT hybrid score/dictionary/abbreviation semantics. Constant false flags are only justified if these modules truly absent.",
    "Fresh DictVectorizer.fit_transform and fresh HGB for each original outer48/held16, using original three nested32 generators for training rows. Keep held labels out of candidate construction/selection and keep original target folds.",
    "If later authorized full64/originaldev: concatenate four rebuilt held16 pools, fresh full64 HGB on train64 labels, then new NCR dev input cache and new probabilities. Existing pre-BioBERT dev scores may provide only candidate rows after removing selector_probability, never posterior values.",
    "Record actual feature_names/model schema and full module dependency/parameter inventory; deleting six columns alone from old model, or retaining BioBERT-only candidates/logits/support while deducting its parameters, is invalid."
