  "isolation_limit": "Current eight pools support only their recorded original four outer folds. A different holdout/subset must retrace every candidate generator (H40); full64 model cannot score a train64 subset as heldout. Independent public input-only forwards may share across folds because no task-label fit, but learned HGB and task-trained base/CRF/Sap generators remain fold-specific.",
